      why: "Pairs that make 10 are the <b>most useful pattern</b> in all of arithmetic. Collect them all!" },
    { q: "7 + 6 = ?  (Trick: first 7 + 3 to reach 10, then 3 more.)",
      type: "number", answer: 13,
      hints: ["7 + 3 = 10. You used 3 of the 6, so 3 are left.", "10 + 3 = ?"],
      why: "<b>Over the ten!</b> Splitting numbers to reach 10 first makes big sums easy." }
  ]
},
