      type: "choice", choices: ["π (pi)", "φ (phi)", "e", "√2"], answer: 0,
      hints: ["A Greek letter – the most famous number in mathematics.", "3.14159…"],
      why: "π = C : d is the same for <b>every</b> circle – a natural constant of geometry. Hence: C = d·π = 2r·π." },
    { q: "A bicycle wheel has diameter 70 cm. How far does it roll in one turn (cm)? (π ≈ 3.14)",
      type: "number", answer: 219.8, tol: 0.7, unit: "cm",
